{"id":"n1-121","title":"Verb ずにはすまない","romaji":"Verb zuni wa sumanai","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"'Cannot do without...', 'unavoidable', 'have to'.","longExplanation":"The grammar point ずにはすまない is used when something must be done due to social/moral obligation, necessity, or rules. It implies that there is no way around taking that action.","formation":"Verb-ない form (remove ない) + ずにはすまない","examples":[{"jp":"この問題を解決しないと、社会全体が影響を受けるので、解決せずにはすまない。","romaji":"Kono mondai o kaiketsu shinai to, shakai zentai ga eikyō o ukeru node, kaiketsu sezu ni wa sumanai.","en":"Since this issue will affect the entire society if not resolved, we cannot do without solving it.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"問題","vocabId":"1536010","reading":"もんだい"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"解決","vocabId":"1198960","reading":"かいけつ"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"社会","vocabId":"1322700","reading":"しゃかい"},{"surface":"全体","vocabId":"1395660","reading":"ぜんたい"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"影響","vocabId":"1173660","reading":"えいきょう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"受けるので","vocabId":"1329590","reading":"うけるので","baseForm":"受ける"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"解決","vocabId":"1198960","reading":"かいけつ"},{"surface":"せ","vocabId":"2147990","reading":"せ","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すま","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"すむ"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[17,18,19,20,21]},{"jp":"これは子供たちの未来を思うと、教育改革を行わずにはすまないことだ。","romaji":"Kore wa kodomo-tachi no mirai o omou to, kyōiku kaikaku o okonawazu ni wa sumanai koto da.","en":"For the sake of the children’s future, we cannot avoid carrying out educational reforms.","words":[{"surface":"これ","vocabId":"1628530","reading":"これ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"子供たち","vocabId":"1307870","reading":"こどもたち"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"未来","vocabId":"1528060","reading":"みらい"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"思うと","vocabId":"1589350","reading":"おもうと","baseForm":"思う"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"教育","vocabId":"1236950","reading":"きょういく"},{"surface":"改革","vocabId":"1200780","reading":"かいかく"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行わず","vocabId":"1589060","reading":"おこなわず","baseForm":"行う"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すま","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"すむ"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[11,12,13,14,15]},{"jp":"この件については、彼に謝らずにはすまない。","romaji":"Kono ken ni tsuite wa, kare ni ayamarazu ni wa sumanai.","en":"Regarding this matter, I can’t do without apologizing to him.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"件","vocabId":"1255940","reading":"けん"},{"surface":"について","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"謝らず","vocabId":"1323010","reading":"あやまらず","baseForm":"謝る"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すま","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"すむ"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7,8,9,10,11]},{"jp":"結婚式に出席するなら、プレゼントを渡さずにはすまない。","romaji":"Kekkonshiki ni shusseki suru nara, purezento o watasazu ni wa sumanai.","en":"If you attend a wedding, you have to bring a gift.","words":[{"surface":"結婚式","vocabId":"1254810","reading":"けっこんしき"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"出席","vocabId":"1339460","reading":"しゅっせき"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"なら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"プレゼント","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"渡さず","vocabId":"1444610","reading":"わたさず","baseForm":"渡す"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すま","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"すむ"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[8,9,10,11,12]}],"formalityLevel":"very-formal-literary","usageNote":"Formal, literary \"cannot get away without doing X/is unavoidable\".","family":{"id":"cant-help-but","name":"Can't Help But (Overwhelming Feeling)","relatedPoints":["n2-079","n2-084","n1-137","n2-065","n2-085"],"axis":"register"},"kind":"construction"}